WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:14.390
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.560 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:21.960
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.070
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:29.010
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>All of residents of an old family estate</i> <i>vanish in one night.</i>

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.290
<i>Three days have passed</i>

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.960
<i>since the discovery of a modern-day</i> <i>spiriting away incident.</i>

00:00:39.170 --> 00:00:41.040
<i>Still no clues have been found.</i>

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.970
<i>As for the missing persons cases</i> <i>here in Ginsei City...</i>

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:46.640
<i>already after the start of this year,</i> <i>it is the...whoa!</i>

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:48.250
<i>Who are you guys?</i>
<i>Hey stop!</i>

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:49.840
<i>Kazuki, are you watching?!</i>

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:57.180
Traces of your blood...

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:00.050
are still left.

00:01:01.730 --> 00:01:03.060
Ten days ago,

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:06.260
you got involved in the world of alchemy and battle.

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:11.240
Even now l still feel bad about that.
You really did good.

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:16.110
l haven't done any good at all.

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:17.870
ln the end,

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:20.700
l wasn't able to carry out any of the things l have said.

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:24.070
And besides, with these hands, l...

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:27.610
Chono said it at the end...

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:30.720
<i>Don't apologize, hypocrite!</i>

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:37.360
l did my best.
But...l wonder if l'm a hypocrite?

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:39.360
Kazuki...

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:45.060
Whether for Good, or for Evil,

00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:50.240
there is no shame in holding onto your beliefs until the very end.

00:01:50.980 --> 00:01:53.140
lf you're in doubt of being a hypocrite...

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:56.480
keep fighting, Kazuki Muto!

00:01:56.580 --> 00:01:57.600
Warrior Chief.

00:01:58.450 --> 00:01:59.380
<i>This person is the warrior chief?</i>

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:02.020
The next battle will soon begin.

00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:03.490
The next battle?

00:02:04.420 --> 00:02:05.860
Will you keep fighting?

00:02:06.420 --> 00:02:10.160
lf you have such an intention, on my authority...

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:15.130
l recruit you to be an alchemist warrior!

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:23.240
<i>Whether or not You're a Hypocrite</i>

00:02:28.310 --> 00:02:29.510
Since last week,

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:31.980
your English teacher, Mita Sensei, has been hospitalized due to illness.

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:33.810
Therefore, starting this week...

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:40.220
<i>lf you're in doubt of being a hypocrite,</i> <i>then keep fighting, Kazuki Muto!</i>

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:43.520
Now, l will introduce a transfer student.

00:02:44.560 --> 00:02:45.090
You...

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:48.730
Hey!

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:52.970
Check her out!

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:54.670
<i>Tokiko.</i>

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:57.270
This is Tokiko Tsumura and as of today,

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:58.710
she will become your new classmate.

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:03.010
What an awful scar.
That's kind of scary.

00:03:03.080 --> 00:03:04.980
What do you do to get like that?

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:07.580
<i>lt's the same as the school</i> <i>l infiltrated before.</i>

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:10.380
<i>Like always,</i> <i>l'm more at ease with being alone.</i>

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.060
Okay then, introduce yourself or something.

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.320
There's nothing in particular to say.

00:03:16.690 --> 00:03:18.220
<i>Right. This is as is should be.</i>

00:03:19.060 --> 00:03:22.120
<i>No way should l be able</i> <i>to enjoy a school life now.</i>

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:26.290
Umm, then does anyone have a question or something?

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:26.930
Yes!

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:29.470
What the heck is your relationship with Kazuki?

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:31.030
Please tell us already.

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:33.470
Yes-yes! l want to know, too.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:34.740
Mappi, this is a second-year class.

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:36.340
Homeroom has started, l tell you.

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:39.570
What-what? You're associated with the four stooges plus one?!

00:03:39.650 --> 00:03:40.550
What relationship?!

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:42.720
Say-say, what's your relationship?

00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:50.060
<i>lt's kind of different from</i> <i>the previous school!</i>

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:52.830
l refuse to answer stuff about the scar and Kazuki!

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:54.030
Questions about anything else?

00:03:54.430 --> 00:03:55.660
When's your birthday and what's your sign?

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:57.470
August 7 and Leo.

00:03:57.600 --> 00:03:58.660
Where do you live?

00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:00.230
ln the dorms as of today.

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:01.860
You won't wear our uniform?

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:03.470
lt flaps and it's hard to move around in...

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:04.630
What're your hobbies and talents?

00:04:04.710 --> 00:04:06.230
Training, and changing clothes quickly.

00:04:06.310 --> 00:04:07.400
What's your type?

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:08.740
l'm not interested in love!

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.010
Talk to me dirty.

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:11.140
You stupid pig.

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:14.420
Just a minute!
The last one wasn't a question!

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.320
Who was it?!

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:17.680
They look like they're having so much fun.

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:20.190
So, what is the relationship between you two?

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:22.520
We'll just continue to leave it as a secret, okay?

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:32.730
l'm alive!

00:04:33.470 --> 00:04:34.940
Good morning.

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:39.300
You're awake, Koshaku.
No, now you're Papillon, correct?

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:40.440
Who're you?!

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:44.040
l never thought someone would single-handedly complete

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:46.380
the research l left behind.

00:04:46.450 --> 00:04:49.780
l did it on a whim thinking it'd be a hint for my successor.

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:52.990
l guess it pays off to be immortal.

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:56.750
Complete the research? lmmortal?

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:59.030
Could it be you're my great-great-grandfather,

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:00.220
Bakushaku Chono?

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:04.490
l discarded that name after l quit being a human...

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:09.170
l'm now called Doctor Butterfly by my brethren.

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:12.800
Welcome, Papillon.

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:16.200
ln acknowledgement of your superior intellect and ability to take action,

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:19.940
l welcome you to our League of Extraordinary Elects!

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:21.450
The LXE.

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:24.510
First off, we'll restore that body of yours.

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:26.220
And then you shall be granted

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:31.700
the true power of the humanoid homunculus you still didn't possess,

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:35.600
so as not to be beaten by the likes of humans ever again!

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:37.490
So, how do you feel?

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.470
Super awesome!

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:42.310
So? Feel like you'll be able to get used to school?

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:43.760
Thanks to you.

00:05:44.210 --> 00:05:48.540
But why are you and l in the same class?
You're older than l am.

00:05:49.050 --> 00:05:53.310
Maybe the warrior chief did us this favor so the mission would be easier to execute.

00:05:53.820 --> 00:05:55.450
But to be honest,

00:05:55.550 --> 00:05:59.110
it was easier to operate the way things were until now.

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:01.120
What's that warrior chief like?

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:03.090
What's he like?
He's the way you saw it.

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:07.320
He always hides himself in that coat and he's unidentifiable.

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:10.530
l haven't been told about his name, background, or anything at all.

00:06:11.400 --> 00:06:14.800
A mystery man, huh? ls it because it's cooler that way?

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:17.240
l definitely don't think that's the reason.

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:21.740
The only thing l know is that whenever that elusive man appears,

00:06:21.980 --> 00:06:27.320
a large battle is bound to occur, and that he has a habit of saying, "Bravo."

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:32.050
And so as of today, l'm the new manager of this dorm.

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:33.690
Please call me Captain Bravo.

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:34.690
<i>Warrior Chief!</i>

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:37.960
Stop being silly and please tell us your real name.

00:06:38.260 --> 00:06:41.160
Bravo! You picked up on something good.

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:44.130
However, my real name's a secret.

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:47.190
Because...it's cooler that way!

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:48.070
—What?
—Really?!

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:50.270
Tokiko. That manager...

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:52.980
That's right. l don't want to believe it, but...

00:06:53.240 --> 00:06:54.940
l kind of feel like we can get along well!

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:56.980
Quit acting stupid!

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:58.080
Huh? What?

00:06:58.150 --> 00:06:59.450
You haven't picked up on it?

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:02.190
Oh, hey-hey.
The fool and the witty one there...

00:07:02.350 --> 00:07:04.720
Quit the make-out strawberry stuff

00:07:04.790 --> 00:07:07.090
while someone's taking the time to introduce themselves!

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:10.760
We have something to discuss.
Come to the manager's office later...

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:12.560
A story?

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:14.760
Yes. From one hundred years ago,

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:17.730
right around the time when l was still human...

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:22.230
At the time, alchemy was considered dubious

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:24.570
and treated as the occult.

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:28.100
But l sniffed out the absolute real deal

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:30.010
and immersed myself in research.

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:33.040
However, it was just independent study when all was said and done.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:35.950
l identified the existence of homunculi and kakugane,

00:07:36.020 --> 00:07:38.150
but ended up running out of leads there.

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:41.350
But then he appeared.

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:42.790
He--?!

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:43.860
A traitor?
<i>Manager's Office</i>

00:07:44.530 --> 00:07:45.260
That's right.

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:48.060
A hundred years ago, there was a man who, despite being an alchemist warrior,

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:50.890
turned himself into a homunculus and fled.

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:52.630
l've heard that before.

00:07:53.100 --> 00:07:55.470
As l recall, he was a very strong warrior

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:57.870
who was chased all the way to Japan following a desperate struggle.

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.000
And at the very end,

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:02.980
he got away and has been missing for a hundred years since then.

00:08:03.410 --> 00:08:05.680
Bravo. That's my Tokiko the warrior.

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:10.110
As a result of learning of the existence of the alchemist Bakushaku Chono

00:08:10.190 --> 00:08:13.560
by way of the Papillon incident and conducting another investigation,

00:08:14.190 --> 00:08:15.560
two lines have been connected.

00:08:16.230 --> 00:08:19.290
The traitor and Bakushaku Chono have joined forces in this land.

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:21.760
He suffered serious injuries.

00:08:22.230 --> 00:08:26.430
And l pledged to conduct research and completely heal his injuries without fail

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:31.030
in exchange for him teaching me everything about alchemy.

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:33.740
lt took a hundred years,

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:35.900
but it appears to be a success this time for sure.

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:40.250
l get it. So l'm the guinea pig, huh?

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:42.010
Remember this.

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:45.380
He is our leader, the leader of the LXE.

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:49.220
And he's the man who will become the king of all homunculi.

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:53.160
l see. Then we should make room on this throne quickly, right?

00:08:56.230 --> 00:08:59.070
ls this...the restoration flask's power?

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:00.400
Or...

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:02.810
l have one favor to ask...

00:09:03.010 --> 00:09:05.170
l wonder if you could prepare some lovely clothes for me!

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:08.240
There's a man l can't wait to meet.

00:09:09.680 --> 00:09:10.940
The mission this time is...

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:14.310
get to the bottom of the League of Extraordinary Elects

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:15.720
led by Doctor Butterfly!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.610
And then destroy it!

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:19.850
Looking at the fact that a name has been identified,

00:09:20.090 --> 00:09:22.290
it seems the investigation is already being conducted, right?

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:26.900
Yes. l've already deployed one individual l brought here three days ago.

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:30.630
Then including that warrior, three of us will be on the mission?

00:09:30.770 --> 00:09:32.630
No, it'll probably be two.

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:35.140
There's been no contact since two days ago.

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:37.140
And so, Kazuki Muto...

00:09:37.940 --> 00:09:40.170
l'd like you to become the new third person.

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:44.710
lt seems you're still reluctant to decide.

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:54.850
l'm kind of half and half on it...

00:09:57.590 --> 00:09:59.650
Half of me thinks l have to fight with the power of alchemy

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:02.600
if there are still dangerous guys out there.

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:05.630
But the other half of me thinks l don't have enough power

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:09.300
and things will turn out like they did in the Chono incident.

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:12.910
l don't think you should fight anymore.

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:15.810
You should leave the fighting to us warriors

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:17.310
and go back to your normal high school life.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:18.080
Muto!

00:10:18.950 --> 00:10:21.350
Phone! He says he's a friend of yours.

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:23.550
A friend? l wonder who it is.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:25.210
Yeah, hello?

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:28.290
Hm? You sound kind of down.

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:31.060
lt kind of worries me how l, the loser, am chipper

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:34.260
and you, the winner, are depressed!

00:10:34.430 --> 00:10:35.160
Wha--?!

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:37.100
<i>lf you like, why don't we meet tomorrow?</i>

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:39.030
Kazuki Muto!

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:40.290
Koshaku Chono!

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:51.740
What's that?!

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:53.880
Hey, over here, over here!

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:56.180
Koshaku Chono!

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:59.720
Why don't we go somewhere inside instead of standing here talking?

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:04.720
One Hamburger Meal A and two medium coffees...

00:11:05.160 --> 00:11:08.890
Will that be for here... or to go?

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:09.930
For here.

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.970
Thank you. Enjoy.

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:14.860
You don't have to be so vigilant.

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:17.030
l have no intention of fighting today.

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:19.200
Leave the clowning around to your get-up!

00:11:19.710 --> 00:11:21.370
Clowning around? What?

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:23.570
Aren't these clothes of mine so wonderful

00:11:23.650 --> 00:11:25.880
that l could just rush to a ballroom dance?!

00:11:26.110 --> 00:11:27.100
Right, Muto?!

00:11:27.780 --> 00:11:30.310
At least it's better than the other day when you only had a pair of underwear on.

00:11:30.390 --> 00:11:31.250
A pair of underwear?!

00:11:31.450 --> 00:11:35.580
Even so, that was a sexual violet cool and l am pretty fond of it, though.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:37.590
You're definition of cool is mistaken.

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:40.720
Just make it the mask. That's cool.

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:43.060
Don't give me that.
First, take off the mask!

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:47.160
l can't do that! I'll never take it off in front of people ever again.

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:49.900
This is a testament to me having quit being human.

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:53.680
l had my body restored,

00:11:53.740 --> 00:11:57.040
but the disease set in my very foundation is still as it was.

00:11:58.110 --> 00:12:01.520
l actually haven't yet gotten back the physical strength to be able to fight.

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:05.220
Also, l still haven't obtained the so-called true power.

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:06.950
—True power?!
—True power?!

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:09.960
Muto, you don't seem to be at your best, either.

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:12.430
So for the time being, we'll just declare hostilities for today.

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:16.260
We'll fight after we're both thoroughly prepared.

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:17.160
Then...

00:12:17.530 --> 00:12:19.690
it wasn't necessary for me to go to the trouble of coming l suppose?

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:21.970
Captain Bravo!

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:23.060
Warrior Chief!

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:26.500
Clerk, I'll also have one Hamburger Meal A.

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:30.410
Will that be for here... or to go?

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:31.440
For here.

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:32.450
Manager!

00:12:32.650 --> 00:12:35.950
You don't need to pay, so please have it to go!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:39.420
What wonderful service! Bravo! l think I'll start coming here a lot.

00:12:39.550 --> 00:12:41.790
Me, too. Totally awesome!

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:43.120
—Yiiiiikes!
—Yiiiiikes!

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:46.550
<i>They paid for their food!!</i>

00:12:49.100 --> 00:12:50.660
Mmm, delicious.

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:53.300
This drippy flavor of blood is great.

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:55.400
That's the taste of blood you spit up.

00:12:55.470 --> 00:12:56.800
So that was it?!

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:59.040
l guess that's okay, too...

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:02.110
l wonder how many years it's been since l've come to school.

00:13:02.340 --> 00:13:03.470
Blast one over!

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:04.810
Here l go!

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:06.200
Eat this!

00:13:06.280 --> 00:13:07.150
Dodge ball?

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:09.550
But nothing has changed at all.

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:12.080
No matter whose voice l hear...

00:13:12.820 --> 00:13:14.790
it only sounds like...snickering...

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:17.920
Even after being reborn as a Superhuman,

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:20.360
it seems the world doesn't change at all.

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:25.060
As l thought before, maybe it would be best to burn it all down

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:28.870
and then create a world more suited for me.

00:13:30.810 --> 00:13:34.370
The LXE doesn't satisfy you enough,
Koshaku Chono?!

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:37.140
l've had enough seclusion, you see.

00:13:37.610 --> 00:13:38.310
And...

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:41.010
Don't call me Koshaku Chono!

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:43.510
Only Kazuki Muto may call me by that name!

00:13:44.590 --> 00:13:47.650
Muto, l don't feel like asking you why you're not yourself.

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:49.120
And l don't really want to know, either.

00:13:49.960 --> 00:13:52.950
But eventually, I'll settle things with you no matter what.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.490
l just won't be satisfied unless l do.

00:13:57.300 --> 00:13:58.130
Chono!

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:03.600
I'll also settle things with you, no matter what!

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:06.030
You seem to have cheered up a little.

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:07.910
l guess l'm kind of happy...

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:11.350
Do you know what you're talking about, Kazuki?

00:14:12.650 --> 00:14:16.520
Settling things means killing him one more time.

00:14:17.050 --> 00:14:18.680
Can you do that?

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:28.590
Sorry to interrupt, but it seems now there's something we must do...

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:29.790
lt's an enemy.

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:33.290
Unlike Papillon, this one seems to possess true power.

00:14:37.370 --> 00:14:39.100
The experiment's a success...

00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:41.570
Then will we finally take care of his healing?

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:46.270
lt'll be after the maintenance, we can't do it right away.

00:14:46.510 --> 00:14:47.850
l can't wait.

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.510
By the way, what about Papillon?

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:53.240
He went out in the elegant suit l prepared for him.

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:55.220
lt seems he went to declare hostilities against...

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:56.660
a warrior he has deep connections with.

00:14:57.290 --> 00:15:00.320
lt's probably an associate of the guy we took care of the other day.

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:01.990
Oh, my. Will it be okay?

00:15:02.130 --> 00:15:04.030
There won't be any slipups in that area.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:07.070
l made sure to send Kinjo to keep an eye on him!

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:08.970
Homunculus!

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:09.800
Buso...!

00:15:10.340 --> 00:15:11.200
Renkin!

00:15:16.610 --> 00:15:20.280
Right Hand Gauntlet Buso Renkin,
Peaky Gulliver!

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:23.880
The difference between a humanoid and an animal-type

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:25.940
is not something inconsequential

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:28.680
as methods of prey or having superior power and a human body!

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:31.890
No matter how much human knowledge animal-types acquire,

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:35.060
they can only fight instinctively with their own claws and fangs.

00:15:35.630 --> 00:15:39.120
Only humanoids can fight with a command of various weapons

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:41.700
with their own fighting instincts.

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:43.130
ln other words...

00:15:43.200 --> 00:15:47.110
they can use kakugane as a Buso Renkin just like us.

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:50.110
This is the true power of the humanoid homunculi!

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:52.350
l can take care of the weak-looking ones later!

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:55.340
You there, in the coat!
I'll start with you first.

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:59.980
Homunculus power exceeding humans

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:02.720
and Buso Renkin power exceeding modern science!

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:06.890
Can you beat what could be called the most powerful combination

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:09.430
of these two alchemies with just one Buso Renkin?

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:13.560
Yes, we will!
That is why we alchemist warriors exist!

00:16:13.670 --> 00:16:14.860
Buso Renkin!

00:16:17.270 --> 00:16:18.570
Lance Buso Renkin.

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:20.470
Sunlight Heart!

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:23.070
Energy full blast! Go!

00:16:25.180 --> 00:16:27.740
l said l can take care of you weak ones later.

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:31.020
Jousting renamed to, Sunlight Slasher!

00:16:38.060 --> 00:16:39.690
His fist got huge!

00:16:39.990 --> 00:16:41.490
Why are you surprised?

00:16:41.800 --> 00:16:45.200
You should at least know that a Buso Renkin isn't just a weapon.

00:16:45.570 --> 00:16:47.830
This is the special property of my Peaky Gulliver!

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:49.560
You little--!

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:53.870
I'll burst through as is with the Sunlight Slasher!

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:56.000
You wish! Laputa Fall!

00:16:56.810 --> 00:17:00.410
No way will a homunculus lose to the likes of a human in a power match!

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:03.020
Kazuki!

00:17:09.520 --> 00:17:10.650
You okay, Kazuki?

00:17:10.890 --> 00:17:13.660
Yeah. Tokiko, he's formidable!

00:17:13.830 --> 00:17:14.450
l know!

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:15.860
Buso!

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:19.170
Pull back, both of you!
I'll fight!

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:20.360
Warrior Chief!

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:21.800
This guy's a small fry,

00:17:21.870 --> 00:17:24.470
but even you guys as a team can't beat him now!

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:26.300
Me, a small fry?

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:28.170
Surprisingly, you haven't got a discerning eye for character!

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:31.980
As l recall, that kakugane had the serial number 52.

00:17:32.280 --> 00:17:32.940
Huh?

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:34.380
You're sure observant.

00:17:34.580 --> 00:17:36.680
Exactly. l got the all-clear to receive the item

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:39.880
from the warrior
Moon Face took care of.

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:42.750
By any chance, was he one of your subordinates?

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:45.460
l see, l see. That can't be helped.

00:17:45.530 --> 00:17:48.550
Are you now blind with anger?

00:17:48.700 --> 00:17:53.000
No, a warrior's defeat means death. l am not angry.

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:54.930
Hey, you're surprisingly cold!

00:17:55.040 --> 00:17:57.560
Here l go! Brobdingnag Knuckles!

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:03.370
What's this?!

00:18:04.110 --> 00:18:06.170
lt's totally hard! No way?!

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:09.480
Metal Jacket Buso Renkin, Silver Skin!

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:13.950
lt instantly metalizes and then regenerates in response to a blow!

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:17.560
Did you think l'm dressed like this for show?

00:18:17.690 --> 00:18:18.720
<i>—l did!</i>
<i>—l did!</i>

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:23.560
Not bad! But it's just an exclusively defensive Buso Renkin, right?

00:18:24.900 --> 00:18:27.700
Brobdingnag Finger Strike!

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:29.370
l do have a weapon!

00:18:29.440 --> 00:18:32.530
My thoroughly trained warrior body is my weapon.

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:44.670
Y-You...You're angry, after all, right?

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:48.620
l told you, l'm not angry...at all!

00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:52.820
Wow! He's intensely strong...!
But...

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:00.970
<i>Bravo really isn't angry.</i>

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:03.500
<i>He looked like he was going</i> <i>to cry at any moment.</i>

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:08.500
Bravo. Tokiko.

00:19:08.980 --> 00:19:09.770
I'll do it.

00:19:10.310 --> 00:19:14.150
lf we leave the LXE as is, this town will go to pieces.

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:16.120
Somebody has to fight now

00:19:16.450 --> 00:19:18.220
in order for Mahiro, Rokumasu and the others,

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:22.120
the people in school and in town, can live in peace.

00:19:23.160 --> 00:19:26.890
Being called a hypocrite, becoming pained by my own shame,

00:19:27.360 --> 00:19:28.520
l think l can bear it

00:19:28.600 --> 00:19:32.360
if it's taking the place of everyone suffering and feeling sadness.

00:19:33.170 --> 00:19:36.970
So Tokiko, I'll keep fighting, after all.

00:19:37.970 --> 00:19:40.910
Captain Bravo! Please make me into an alchemist warrior!

00:19:41.580 --> 00:19:44.880
Kazuki Muto, you won't be able to win

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:47.580
by relying only upon the power of the Buso Renkin.

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:52.580
You will certainly lose and die after your next fight.

00:19:54.520 --> 00:19:56.920
First, in order to make you into an alchemist warrior,

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:58.530
I'll train you without mercy.

00:19:58.960 --> 00:19:59.890
lf you don't want to die,

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:02.620
sink your teeth in with a do-or-die resolve! Got it?!

00:20:02.960 --> 00:20:03.560
Yeah.

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:15.980
Another enemy has shown up to target

00:20:16.450 --> 00:20:18.040
the perfect place to feed, the school dorm.

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:20.650
Never again will l let that tragedy repeat itself!

00:20:20.860 --> 00:20:22.980
l will kill the homunculus for sure!

00:20:23.460 --> 00:20:25.480
Next time, "A Night in the Dorm"

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:27.560
I'll splatter your guts out!
